# Settings > On-screen keyboard Off is gone (report 042): a stored Off (osk_mode 1, from an earlier version) reads as
# Auto on the PDA profile too (not as the profile's default Handwriting + keyboard): the Keyboard test's Text field gets
# the standard keyboard (no band), and nothing breaks. Review only, no golden.
title zone old off
review
sizes 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
config osk_mode 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_mode 0
launch Settings
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone hidden
expect_osk shown
expect_vkb auto
shot zone_old_off
